    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39487" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθῡμ-ητικός</span></b>  (hyperdor. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθῡμ-ᾱτικός</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Diotog.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
			Stob.
			4.7.62
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>desiring,
				coveting</i>, <i>lusting after</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
