					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					475b
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐ</span>. <i>that</i>
			part of the soul <i>which is the seat of the desires and
			affections</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				439e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
