			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hell.Oxy.</u>
				16.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				108a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				15.244
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				8.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. διακεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Palaeph.
					23
				</span></i>
			.</div>
